[end_timeline]
label D16B
Grabbing a grenade from your webbing you pull the pin and throw it ahead of you. Unfortunately you're still too far from the enemy trench - the bomb explodes ahead of the enemy position. A German sees you, takes aim with his rifle, and fires a shot that strikes you in the head. You die instantly.
set {chosen_path} = "Death 22"
[end_timeline]
